# Templates are embedded with go:embed and goldens are compared byte-for-byte,
# so a CRLF checkout on Windows would break the template/golden tests.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Rendered from internal/benefits/benefits.yaml by `task docs:benefits`
# (go test ./internal/benefits -run TestRenderedFilesAreCurrent -update).
# Regenerate them on a merge; never resolve a conflict in them by hand.
# internal/benefits' TestGitattributesMarksBenefitRenders pins these lines.
docs/benefits.md linguist-generated=true
docs/why-forge.md linguist-generated=true

# internal/benefits/benefits.yaml is deliberately NOT merge=union. Union is
# unsafe for it: two edits to one folded-prose field (claim, why, use,
# thesis) keep both versions of the line, which parses and validates; and two
# entries added at the same spot interleave on their shared lines
# (availability:, evidence:, blank lines), moving fields between entries.
